    "body": "Numbered IDs now use one shared prefix-unit component. Lists and detail headings show exactly one # before the value in a darker, muted shade. FF8 Items, Shops, Weapons, Magic, Enemies, and GF General use it. Name remains the default sort, and technical keys such as itm_alpha are not changed. Hidden-window checks passed at both tested sizes with no overflow.",
